            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In 1996, the American Nurses Credentialing Center in Washington, DC, recognized the UC Davis Medical Center in Sacramento as a magnet nursing center of excellence. The pain management program was cited as one of the distinguishing activities that promotes quality of patient care services and development of successful nursing strategies.</AbstractText>
